<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>About CraveCart</title>
  <style>
    :root { --orange: #f97316; --ink: #18211b; --muted: #667085; --cream: #fffaf3; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; } body { margin: 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: var(--ink); background: var(--cream); }
    nav, main, footer { max-width: 920px; margin: auto; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; }
    nav { height: 76px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
    .brand { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--orange); text-decoration: none; }.nav-link { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
    .hero { text-align: center; padding: 72px 0 58px; }.eyebrow { color: var(--orange); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(42px, 6vw, 62px); line-height: 1.06; margin: 14px auto 20px; max-width: 720px; }.lead { color: var(--muted); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.65; max-width: 690px; margin: auto; }
    .story { background: white; border-radius: 22px; padding: 38px; margin-bottom: 50px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px #5d3c1a10; }.story p { line-height: 1.7; color: var(--muted); }
    .values { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; padding-bottom: 54px; }.value { background: #fff2e4; border-radius: 16px; padding: 22px; }.value h3 { margin: 10px 0 8px; }.value p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; } footer { padding-bottom: 32px; color: var(--muted); } @media (max-width: 650px) { .values { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }.story { padding: 26px; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav><a class="brand" href="/home">CraveCart</a><a class="nav-link" href="/home">Browse food</a></nav>
  <main>
    <section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow">About CraveCart</div><h1>We make good food easier to enjoy.</h1><p class="lead">CraveCart connects hungry people with the independent restaurants and food makers that make every neighbourhood feel like home.</p></section>
    <section class="story"><h2>Made for the moments that matter</h2><p>Whether it is a busy workday, a family dinner, or a late-night craving, ordering food should feel simple and reliable. We help customers find dishes they love, while giving local restaurants more ways to grow.</p><p>Our platform brings together easy discovery, clear pricing, secure ordering, and real-time delivery updates—so every meal arrives with less hassle and more joy.</p></section>
    <section class="values"><div class="value"><div>🤝</div><h3>Local first</h3><p>We celebrate the restaurants and cooks that make each community unique.</p></div><div class="value"><div>🧡</div><h3>Care in every order</h3><p>From checkout to delivery, we design for a dependable experience.</p></div><div class="value"><div>🌱</div><h3>Better together</h3><p>We grow responsibly with our customers, partners, and riders.</p></div></section>
  </main>
  <footer>© 2026 CraveCart · Delivering a little happiness, daily.</footer>
</body>
</html>
